ric-lomari\">\n    hoan-kièng piêk-goà boe-bâh-jang\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>燒肉粽<rt>쇼ˉ빻ˆ장</rt></ruby> <ruby>燒肉粽<rt>쇼ˉ빻ˆ장</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siō-bâh-jang siō-bâh-jang\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>賣<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>燒肉粽<rt>쇼ˉ빻ˆ장</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    boe-siō-bâh-jang\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>物件<rt>밓걀ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一日<rt>짇띧-</rt></ruby><ruby>一日<rt>짇띧ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>貴<rt>귀</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    mih-kiā̰ jit-rit-jit-rît kui\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>厝內<rt>추ˋ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>頭喙<rt>ᄐᅷ취</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"jiâh\">遮<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>大堆<rt>돠뒤ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chù-lāi thau-chui jiâh-toa-tûi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>雙跤<rt>샹ˉ카ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>走<rt>ᄌᅷˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>到<rt>ᄀᅷˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>牚腿<rt>틸ˋ튀ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siāng-khâ jâu-kàu-bêh-thḭ̀-thùi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>拄<rt>두ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>銷<rt>ᄉᆤˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>上<rt>셩-</rt></ruby><ruby>克虧<rt>켹ˆ퀴ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tû-tioh-bo-siâu siong-khiêk-khûi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>認真<rt>띤진ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>賣<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>燒肉粽<rt>쇼ˉ빻ˆ장</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    rin-jīn-lai-boe-siō-bâh-jang\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>燒肉粽<rt>쇼ˉ빻ˆ장</rt></ruby> <ruby>燒肉粽<rt>쇼ˉ빻ˆ장</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric